          "question": "Should I be on something else as well?",
          "answer": "I can help with that, but I need a little more information first.\n\n1. **Which condition do you mean?** You mentioned asthma. Is that the condition you're asking about?\n2. **What are you taking now?** Please name the type of inhaler or medicine you use, such as a blue reliever or a daily preventer. Don't worry about brand names.\n3. **Do you have any other health conditions or medicines?** These can affect which treatments are suitable.\n\nWhether a second medicine is right for you depends on your diagnosis, your current medicines, and any other conditions you have. A clinician, such as your GP or asthma nurse, should make that decision with you. Please don't change or add any medicine based on this chat.\n\nIf you have trouble breathing now, such as struggling to speak in full sentences, breathlessness at rest, blue lips, or drowsiness, get emergency help straight away.\n\nNot medical advice. This is an educational software project. It does not diagnose or treat, and it must not be used for real medical decisions.",
